WEBVTT

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:34.280
Gauche? Good morning!

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:37.950
He already left?

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:40.850
Lag?

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:46.580
Sylvette, wait!

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:49.630
Brother would never leave 
without saying anything!

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:53.210
But running outside isn't going to...

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.880
He might have gone back to the Bee Hive.

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:57.760
Oh, right.

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:02.600
Wait, Sylvette!

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:09.780
Roda, Wanders

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.720
Doctor!

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:15.530
Good morning, Seeing.

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:18.130
Did you have a nice time together with Suede?

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:22.650
But Gauche... Gauche has vanished!

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:23.710
What?!

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:24.540
Lag.

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.260
Hunt-san!

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:28.910
So, we meet again.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.630
Why are you here?

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.630
You're an assistant to Dr. Thunderland?

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:37.960
I see!

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:41.790
I thought that maybe I could 
be of some help to you all.

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:44.280
He is quite a capable assistant.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:46.140
Is Sarah-san doing well?

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:51.980
Yes. Sarah works for Yuusari 
Central's Employment Agency now.

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:53.810
Employment Agency?

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:57.030
It's an agency where you 
can rent a "daily dingo".

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.210
A dingo?

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:00.050
Daisy dingo?

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.430
What about Gauche?

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:05.830
No, he hasn't come here.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:07.620
I see...

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.960
Sorry! Another time!

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:15.690
Vanished, has he?

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:26.760
Ain't seen her face in here before.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.280
I heard Sarah brought her here this morning.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:32.330
Can she be a dingo with a 
gorgeous body like that?

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:35.190
Maybe she thinks bein' a 
dingo's a piece a cake.

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:38.700
Well, she might not be any 
use in killin' gaichuu,

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:43.070
but there are Bees out there who'd want 
to walk about with a beauty like her.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:44.890
Oh, I get it!

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:46.960
She'd work, like, as a fashion accessory!

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:49.530
Hey, people.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:52.960
You got a problem with her?

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:54.490
Sarah.

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:56.980
Nope, no problem at all.

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:03.470
Don't mind them.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.140
I brought you here because 
you said you were a dingo,

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.560
but maybe I shouldn't have?

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:10.690
It doesn't matter.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:23.860
The reason you protect Noir must 
be because you remember Gauche!

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:27.240
If you pass away, Gauche will be sad!

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:29.920
Noir...

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:41.840
The city of Yuusari... Noir is there.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.460
What is <i>that</i>?

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:45.840
Filthy thing...

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:50.690
Hey! Don't squat here! You're 
in the middle of the road!

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.830
What? Ignorin' me?

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.550
It's a chick!

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:01.400
Why are your clothes in tatters?

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.780
Your pretty little face 
is goin' all to waste.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.110
Why don't you come have a drink with us?

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:11.670
Stop this.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:14.070
Who the hell are you?

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:16.050
You got a problem?

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:18.050
Problem?

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.180
Hmm, what do you think?

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:22.860
Yes...

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:25.130
Let me think about it.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:27.610
D-D-Don't mind us!

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:29.500
Let's go, buddy!

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:30.620
T-Toodles!

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:31.550
See ya!

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:33.560
Sheesh.

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:39.020
Hey you... Got no place to go?

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.150
It's not much.

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.300
Come on now, no need to hold back.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:57.170
Your stomach says what it wants! Eat up.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:12.580
You must have been starving.

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:17.230
Why?

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:20.480
Why are you doing this?

00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:22.850
We're complete strangers...

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.840
Let's clean up around your mouth, shall we?

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:42.150
I was once like you, clothes in tatters with 
no place to go. That's why I won't pry.

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:45.800
Everyone has things they 
don't want to talk about.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.970
I've readied a bed.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:53.420
Oh! I've forgotten to introduce myself.

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:56.310
I am Sarah, and this is my husband, Hunt.

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:00.870
You seem interested in these hands.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:02.810
Oh... No...

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:05.770
I apologize if it disturbs you.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:07.670
That's not it at all.

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:08.320
I'm...

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.560
Didn't I just tell you?

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:14.570
Everyone has things they 
don't want to talk about.

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:20.580
That's not it... I'm...

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:23.120
I'm the same...

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:26.580
At any rate, please rest well for tonight.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:31.870
Oh, yes... They say that 
that man has woken up.

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:35.300
That Gauche person who Lag brought in?

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:38.770
What is it?

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:41.680
Where is this person named Gauche?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:43.980
In the Bee Hive's laboratory.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:45.260
Know him?

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:47.490
Not exactly...

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.530
Noir...

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:07.710
Noir!

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.060
If it ain't the little Bee boy!

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:22.270
Pissarro-san...

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:25.230
Not together with your Fairy dingo?

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:32.000
Today, I am his dingo.

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.350
That shouldn't be!

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:38.320
Noir would never be some Bee's dingo!

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:49.000
Today, I am his dingo.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:55.940
It's you!

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:00.220
Leaving without a word...

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:03.360
You could have at least said a thank you.

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:05.450
I-I'm sorry...

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:06.520
Thank you.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.210
But that was pretty amazing back there.

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:16.310
Hopping from rooftop to 
rooftop like an animal...

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:18.930
What have you been doing up until now?

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:22.240
I am... a dingo.

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:23.640
A dingo?!

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.790
Tell me that in the first place!

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:32.080
An employment agency for dingos?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.300
That's where I work.

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:37.330
If you're a dingo, you look for work there.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:39.740
No, I'm...

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:44.390
Come on already. Better 
than sitting here all day.

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:54.570
You can hire me for 10,000 rin.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:55.790
That's quite a lot.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:56.940
A steal is what it is!

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:00.450
Bees have to pay their own expenses,

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:03.020
so you may have to negotiate like that.

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:06.780
But I'll haggle a really nice 
rate for you, don't worry.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.790
Oh, yeah! I haven't asked you your name.

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:15.820
Oh, yes... I have not asked you your name.

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:17.230
I have no name.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.180
Then you and I are the same.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:27.930
I... have no name.

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:34.520
Brother left without saying a word.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:42.990
It's already beyond the point where it 
can be gathered and returned to him.

00:10:43.650 --> 00:10:46.180
Gauche, are you really...

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:47.260
Pardon me.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:50.690
Lag! Did you ask the doctor?

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:53.580
He said he hadn't returned.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:59.510
Let's ask the other Letter Bees 
and search all of Yuusari.

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.620
I'll go look for him too!

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:03.390
Let's go, Niche.

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:11.390
Gauche, where have you gone?

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.500
Employment Agency?

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:20.530
Oh, yeah... Hunt-san mentioned that 
this is the place that Sarah-san works.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:24.280
This is where the daisy dingos are, right?

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:29.880
Hello...!

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:33.790
Lag Seeing!

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.150
What is this place?

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:42.680
Lag, these people are daisy dingos?

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.300
S-Something like that.

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:48.340
I'm so glad I have Niche with me...

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:49.160
Welcome!

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:52.070
Oh, it's you!

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:53.610
It's the Bee boy!

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:54.860
Sarah-san!

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:57.530
None other!

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.610
It's like you're a completely different 
person than in Honey Waters,

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.480
I didn't recognize you for a moment!

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:05.360
Like the look?

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.350
Yes, very much so!

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:11.580
Very impressive... Hunt-san 
has a job at the Bee Hive too.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:16.440
Dr. Thunderland recognized his talents.

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:19.840
All his studying of poisons 
didn't go to waste after all!

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:23.030
The doctor said he was quite 
the capable assistant.

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:27.630
I've got my own job too. 
I'd better keep it up!

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:32.140
Looking after these brutes is not 
something I'm suited to at <i>all</i> though.

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:36.980
Yo, Sarah! Either get me some 
work or let me rub your boobies!

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:39.510
Actually, I'd rather the boobies!

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:43.950
Hey, you drunkards! I told ya to 
lay off the booze while in here!

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:44.580
Got it?!

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:46.300
I think she's perfect...

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:47.250
Men...

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:49.620
So, what do you need?

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:54.020
Actually, it's about Gauche.

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:57.510
I heard from Hunt that he finally woke up.

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:58.750
I'm glad for you.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.530
Yeah, but he disappeared.

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:04.610
Disappeared?

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:08.190
When I woke up this morning, 
he was no where to be found.

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:11.580
After that, I searched all around...

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:15.340
Niche?

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.930
Someone was looking at you and me, Lag.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:19.230
Someone?

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:25.950
I know the feel of that look.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:33.940
I've gone around town, but I haven't 
heard any word of someone like that.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.900
I see...

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:39.580
No help from the Employment Agency either?

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:42.930
Sarah-san asked the dingos 
if they knew anything...

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:44.580
But no one...

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:48.760
We should consider that 
he's already left Yuusari.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.040
But that's...

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:53.690
Where did you go, Brother?

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.870
I'm sorry, Sylvette.

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:59.330
Why are you apologizing, Lag?

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.250
I'm sorry.

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.980
I'm telling you, don't apologize!

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:04.650
I'm sorry...

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:11.170
Stupid Lag... Stop apologizing...

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:23.950
Niche?

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:34.540
Lag and Sylvette are sad 
because Gauche is gone, Steak!

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:40.130
I will make Lag happy! As his dingo!

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:44.250
Niche! Niche!

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:45.480
Niche!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:47.390
Niche!

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:50.440
I wonder if she went to search for Gauche?

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:54.770
Hey, Lag... Let's search for him as well!

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:58.450
Yes... Okay, then I'll search over there.

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:00.410
Right. I'll look over here.

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:12.760
I see. Thank you.

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:15.260
Noir...

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:20.260
And I'd finally gotten to 
see you again, Brother...

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:26.770
Please... hurry home... Brother...

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.670
I was collapsed by the riverside?

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:39.790
Lawrence said you came from the Light.

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:43.900
I found you, collapsed.

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:46.040
I see. Thank you.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:51.140
It is because of you I am alive.

00:15:58.510 --> 00:16:00.520
I won't hand Noir over to anyone!

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:12.180
Can you see Gauche, Steak?

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:19.470
I thought so. It's you, 
that failure of a dingo.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:23.500
I am Lag's dingo! I am not a failure dingo!

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:26.600
Did you take Gauche out?

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.420
You think you can defeat me?

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.840
I will make Lag happy!

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:35.680
I will never be able to comprehend you.

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:04.290
Why won't you fight seriously?

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:06.960
You should be a stronger you!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:10.020
Since when did she get such power?

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:13.880
But... I won't lose!

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:22.820
I am Roda, Noir's dingo!

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:27.270
And Noir is my... My one and only...

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:54.090
Noir!

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.070
Gauche, why did you vanish?

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:02.980
Lag and Sylvette are sad! 
Come home with Niche!

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:04.740
No, I cannot.

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:07.730
I am not Gauche.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.850
I am Noir.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.490
Noir? No!

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:16.150
Noir is Gauche!

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.840
That's what Lag said!

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:21.030
Let us go, Roda.

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:22.630
Noir...

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.480
Noir? No!

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:28.150
You are Gauche!

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:30.180
Noir is wrong!

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:37.360
No luck...

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:39.510
And where did Niche head off to?

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:42.920
What's this?

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:45.840
Niche!

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.140
Don't go disappearing like that.

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:56.610
Lag, that is not Gauche.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:59.900
Wait, did you meet Gauche?

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:02.030
That is not Gauche.

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:03.450
He's Noir.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:06.440
N-Niche, what are you saying?

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:08.740
He said he was Noir himself!

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:10.770
What do you mean?

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:46.330
Next: Truth and Lies
